\]

\section{Conclusion}

The Sovereign Substrate Stack is a mathematically formalized replacement for legacy
computational architectures. It establishes a deterministic, cryptographically sealed,
provenance-bound substrate capable of supporting multi-physics engines, anomaly
prospectors, astromorphic simulations, and unmapped-phenomena exploration.

